) values
  ('introduction-background-1-introduce-yourself', 'introduction-background', 'Introduction and Personal Background', 'Introduce yourself.', 'This prompt helps you practise discussing introduction and personal background clearly and honestly. It is an educational exercise, not an official ISSB scoring criterion.', 'easy', 'Anchor personal facts in your own words and keep dates and details consistent. For this question, introduce yourself.', 'commonly-reported', 'Making claims that are too broad or reciting a memorized biography.', 'I am perfect at everything and everyone likes me.', 'This answer is vague, absolute, or unsupported. It gives the interviewer little reliable information about the candidate’s real behaviour.', 'I am currently [your real study or work]. A recent responsibility I handled was [brief example], and I learned [specific lesson].', '["Can you give me a specific example related to “Introduce yourself.”?","What was difficult about that situation, and what did you learn?"]'::jsonb, 1),
